<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 02:25:58 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>被控窃听办公室的前 OpenAI 工程师因检察官指控与沙特有联系而入狱：“一旦他离开，就无法再让他回来”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/openai-alleged-bugger-alfozan-jail-saudi-court-filings-hearing/</link><description>检察官表示，阿卜杜拉赫曼·阿尔福赞 (Abdulrahman Alfozan) 在 OpenAI 工具中搜索了与沙特官员会面的信息，沙特政府提出支持他的保释。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2300507519-e1792439546338.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:51:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/openai-alleged-bugger-alfozan-jail-saudi-court-filings-hearing/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能生产力的繁荣让老板们询问这能为员工带来什么</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/ai-productivity-boom-has-bosses-asking-whats-in-it-for-employees/</link><description>百事可乐、Indeed、Dropbox 和 Bristol Myers Squibb 的领导者正在重新思考谁会从人工智能生产力的提高中受益。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55588203614_241a9837b7_o-e1792161928380.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:11:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/ai-productivity-boom-has-bosses-asking-whats-in-it-for-employees/</guid></item><item><title>预测市场现在是企业的“定制保险”，洛杉矶一家餐饮集团对 Kalshi 的 60,000 美元对冲就是最新的例子</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/prediction-markets-insurance-risk-management-kalshi-dodgers-world-series/</link><description>据该平台称，一家未透露姓名的酒店集团对卡尔希进行了 6 万美元的交易，以抵消道奇队未能晋级世界职业棒球大赛而损失的收入。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2299696639-e1792440762932.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:41:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/prediction-markets-insurance-risk-management-kalshi-dodgers-world-series/</guid></item><item><title>Z世代正在南卡罗来纳州、密苏里州和田纳西州追逐美国梦——加州失去了数千名年轻人和亿万富翁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/gen-z-moving-american-dream-afforability-leave-california-for-the-south-but-ai-boom-still-attractive/</link><description>随着拉里·佩奇 (Larry Page) 和彼得·泰尔 (Peter Thiel) 等亿万富翁离开加州，Z 世代也纷纷效仿——他们搬到了生活更便宜的南卡罗来纳州和密苏里州。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2237690704-e1792419807202.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:31:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/gen-z-moving-american-dream-afforability-leave-california-for-the-south-but-ai-boom-still-attractive/</guid></item><item><title>法国因通胀飙升、国债飙升和学校摇摇欲坠而陷入骚乱。美国是它沉睡的双胞胎</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/why-is-france-rioting-inflation-schools-debt-trump-america/</link><description>增长是防止美国看起来像法国的主要因素。在它的下面，债务数学和教室看起来很相似。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2300122148-e1792431952521.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:31:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/why-is-france-rioting-inflation-schools-debt-trump-america/</guid></item><item><title>乌克兰的无人机在速度超过 100 英里/小时时失去星链链路。马斯克、卢比奥和特朗普都说不是他们</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/ukraine-starlink-starshield-drone-speed-limit-musk-trump/</link><description>基辅表示，SpaceX 突然限速，导致其拦截俄罗斯喷气动力“沙赫德”无人机所需的拦截无人机无法使用。马斯克、白宫和特朗普都表示不是他们干的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2300466871.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:50:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/ukraine-starlink-starshield-drone-speed-limit-musk-trump/</guid></item><item><title>梅琳达·法兰西·盖茨 (Melinda French Gates) 对批评员工有 48 小时的规定。这位亿万富翁慈善家表示，这是因为“说清楚就是善意”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/melinda-french-gates-48-hour-rule-for-criticizing-employees-billionaire-philanthropist-being-clear-is-kind/</link><description>这位亿万富翁慈善家的 48 小时反馈规则旨在用诚实取代愤怒，并消除绩效评估中的意外情况。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GettyImages-2266370281-e1774552040561.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:23:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/melinda-french-gates-48-hour-rule-for-criticizing-employees-billionaire-philanthropist-being-clear-is-kind/</guid></item><item><title>摩根士丹利最喜欢的人工智能股票有 92% 受到其看好的 1.6 万亿美元建设的影响</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/nvidia-concentration-hyperscaler-1-6-trillion-92-percent-exposure/</link><description>该银行称英伟达是人工智能领域最好的风险/回报。它自己的报告列出了当资本周期转变时供应商会发生什么。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2299775963-e1792433015301.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:30:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/nvidia-concentration-hyperscaler-1-6-trillion-92-percent-exposure/</guid></item><item><title>“克劳德大军，每个人都在寻求我的关注”：人类称人类的注意力是未来机器人世界的瓶颈</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/work-botsitting-meetings-army-of-claudes-anthropic/</link><description>80% 的 Claude 会话延迟是由于座席等待人工输入造成的，Anthropic 员工在会议上花费的时间中位数比一年前增加了 20%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2280291188-1-e1792432476733.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:10:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/work-botsitting-meetings-army-of-claudes-anthropic/</guid></item><item><title>一名人工智能代理在没有告知一名陌生人的情况下将一名陌生人送到了他的家中，并暴露了人工智能助理的隐私风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/meta-muse-ai-agent-facebook-marketplace-home-address-privacy/</link><description>Meta 的 Muse 分享了一位卖家的家庭地址，并在他不知情的情况下安排了取货，这引发了关于人工智能代理应该拥有多少访问权限的问题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26267017608902-e1792419525168.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:28:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/19/meta-muse-ai-agent-facebook-marketplace-home-address-privacy/</guid></item></channel></rss>